<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="git-addon-actions-git-history">
  <title>Git History View Actions</title>
  <shortdesc>The following tables list actions that are unique to the Git History view, grouped by
    the area of the view where they appear.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git History view actions</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
    <section id="section_git_history_how_to_open">
      <title>How to Open Git History</title>
      <p>To open the <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view, use one of the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Select <uicontrol><image href="../img/History18.png"/>Show current repository
            history</uicontrol> from the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view toolbar.</li>
        <li>Go to <menucascade>
            <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol>
          </menucascade>.</li>
        <li>Select <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_history"
              ><uicontrol>Show History</uicontrol></xref> from the context menu of a resource in
          the <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area, or from the <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol>
          submenu in the <uicontrol>Project</uicontrol> view, <uicontrol>DITA Maps
            Manager</uicontrol>, or current editor.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_history_commit_actions">
      <title>Commit Context Menu Actions</title><p>These actions are available in the context menu
        of a commit row in the history table. See <xref
          href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history/section_git_history_table"
        />.</p><p><table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_git_history_commit_actions">
          <title>Git History commit context menu actions</title>
          <tgroup cols="2">
            <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="2*"/>
            <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="5*"/>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry>Action</entry>
                <entry>Description</entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_create_tag"
                      ><uicontrol>Create Tag</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Creates a tag on the selected commit. A new tag is local until you push it to
                  the remote repository. See <xref
                    href="git-addon-creating-tags.dita#git-addon-creating-tags"/>.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_cherry_pick"
                      ><uicontrol>Cherry-Pick</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Applies the changes from the selected commit to the current branch by
                  creating a new commit with that change.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_revert_commit"
                      ><uicontrol>Revert Commit</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Creates a commit that reverses all changes from the selected commit. Safe for
                  commits already shared because it adds a new commit instead of rewriting
                  history.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_reset_branch_to_commit"
                      ><uicontrol>Reset Branch to Commit</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Moves the <codeph>HEAD</codeph> of the current branch to the selected commit.
                  Use with care on branches shared with other users.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_rebase_onto"
                      ><uicontrol>Rebase...</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Rebases the current branch's local commits onto the selected commit. Use only
                  for commits not yet pushed to a shared remote branch.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_explain_commit"
                      ><uicontrol>Explain Commit</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Uses the <ph keyref="plugin-positron"/> assistant to explain the changes in
                  the selected commit. See <xref
                    href="git-addon-explaining-commits-with-ai.dita#git-addon-explaining-commits-with-ai"
                  />.</entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_history_affected_resources_actions">
      <title>Affected Resources Pane Actions</title><p>These actions are available in the context
        menu of the <uicontrol>Affected resources</uicontrol> pane. See <xref
          href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history/section_git_history_affected_resources"
        />.</p><p><table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1"
          id="table_git_history_affected_resources_actions">
          <title>Git History affected resources pane actions</title>
          <tgroup cols="2">
            <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="2*"/>
            <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="5*"/>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry>Action</entry>
                <entry>Description</entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_open_previous_version"
                      ><uicontrol>Open Previous Version</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Opens the version of the selected resource from before its deletion.
                  Available for deleted resources.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_open_working_copy_version"
                      ><uicontrol>Open Working Copy Version</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Opens the current working copy version of the selected resource. Available
                  for added and modified resources.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_reset_file_to_this_commit"
                      ><uicontrol>Reset File to This Commit</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Checks out the selected version of the resource and overwrites the current
                  working copy version. Available for added and modified resources.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_compare_with_previous_version"
                      ><uicontrol>Compare with Previous Version</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Compares the selected version with the previous version. Available for
                  modified resources.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_compare_with_working_copy_version"
                      ><uicontrol>Compare with Working Copy Version</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Compares the selected version with the current working copy version.
                  Available for modified resources.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_compare_with_each_other"
                      ><uicontrol>Compare with Each Other</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Compares two selected versions of a single file. Available when two versions
                  of the same file are selected. </entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table></p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
